        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → fal → fal Settings**.\n2. Describe the music in **Song**: its style, its instruments, and its speed.\n3. Press **Run**. The song and one clip per instrument are saved under `audio/fal`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
