          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Stable Audio 3 small makes a 20-second instrumental from **Song**. `duration` in `arguments`, the model's own settings, sets the length. Its `files` output passes the song's fal link, its address on fal storage, on to **Split**, so it is not uploaded again."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        860,
